# Conditions Of Use

## 1. Attribution Requirement

You must provide clear and visible credit to the original creator whenever you share or redistribute this project.

Proper attribution must include:
- The original project name.
- The name or username of the original author.
- A link to the original repository when possible.
- A reference to this license.
- A statement indicating that the work is licensed under CC BY-NC-ND 4.0.

Example attribution:

> “Original project created by [YOUR NAME]. Licensed under CC BY-NC-ND 4.0.”

You may not imply that the original author endorses you, your modifications, or your usage of the project.

---

## 2. Non-Commercial Restriction

You may NOT use this project or any part of it for commercial purposes.

Commercial use includes, but is not limited to:
- Selling copies of the project.
- Selling modified versions.
- Including the project in paid software bundles.
- Using the project in monetized services or platforms.
- Using the project to generate advertising revenue.
- Hosting paid versions of the software.
- Selling access to instances of the project.
- Using the project inside commercial SaaS products.
- Offering paid support specifically for redistributed versions of this project.
- Minting or selling assets from this project as NFTs or digital collectibles.
- Using project branding, logos, or assets for commercial identity purposes.

If you wish to use this project commercially, you must obtain explicit written permission from the copyright holder.

---

## 3. No Derivatives

You may NOT distribute modified versions of this project.

This includes:
- Forks with edited code.
- Rebranded versions.
- Modified assets or graphics.
- Edited documentation.
- Patched binaries.
- Altered configurations intended for redistribution.
- Ports to other platforms distributed publicly.
- Custom builds shared with third parties.
- Modified installers or packages.
- AI-generated variants derived directly from the repository contents.

You are allowed to privately modify the project for personal use only, but you may not publish, upload, sell, distribute, or share those modified versions in any form.

